","currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-10-28T10:03:33Z","releaseNotes":"You can now scan cosmetics and check for ingredients of concern, from allergens to environmental concerns.","version":"3.3.0","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"Know what's in your food and cosmetics! Scan products, explore ingredients and make more informed choices every day.\n\nWhether you're looking to avoid ultra-processed foods, have a food allergy or intolerance, or want to check your cosmetics for ingredients of concern, we've got you covered.\n\nHere's what you can do completely free, with no limits:\n• Scan food and cosmetics to discover what's inside.\n• Check whether foods are ultra-processed or contain allergens you want to avoid.\n• Check cosmetics for ingredients of concern, including allergens, suspected endocrine disruptors and substances of environmental concern.\n• Learn about food additives and what they're used for.\n• Explore nutritional information and ingredient details.\n• Check a product's nutritional quality with Nutri-Score.\n• Create shopping lists and save products for later.\n\nGet even more with Plus:\n• Search for products and additives.\n• Browse categories and discover new products.\n• Get personalised swap suggestions based on your preferences.\n• Set additional preferences for ingredients and additives you'd like to avoid.\n\nTerms of use and privacy:\nhttps://www.thefood.app/terms","sellerUrl":"https://www.thefood.app","languageCodesISO2A":["EN","NB"],"fileSizeBytes":"49326080","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":2251,"trackContentRating":"4+","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.7721,"bundleId":"tryggmat.beneficial.no","releaseDate":"2024-05-01T07:00:00Z","userRatingCount":2251}